{"id":"semantic-recall-parked","parent":"sd-search","ord":"a1","title":"Semantic recall — built, reviewed, parked (draft PR #165)","todo":true,"desc":"- Parked 2026-08-14 at the human's word with the pipeline complete: reviewed, CI green, local llama-cpp + bge-small embedder (~3ms warm queries). Design doc: docs/brainstorming/semantic-recall.md.\n- To resume:\n  - Merge master and re-fit to the moved search seam (#167, #168).\n  - Apply the two ratified re-fit obligations: declare `matched: \"meaning\"` on the format floor; feed the parsed filter (not raw operator text) to the recall leg.\n  - Re-run CI and field for approval.","changed":"2026-08-24T16:04:15-04:00","custom":{"refit-2026-08-24":"roadmap review: the resume list is stale — the cited design doc lives only on the semantic-recall branch (not master); the re-fit target is no longer #167/#168 but addresses (#256), the six-kind Bodied arm (#362 widened filter.ts), and the coming @olai/child (recall/embedder.ts is gone from master; the package must CONSUME @olai/child on return — see child-receptacle)"}}
{"id":"reminders-notifications","parent":"sd-dates","ord":"a0","title":"Reminders: nothing ever alerts you about due work #needs-brainstorm","todo":true,"desc":"- Repeats and the agenda exist, but nothing notifies — no reminders, no due alerts, anywhere.\n- To decide in a brainstorm: the channel (browser notifications, the chat agent speaking up, OS-level), and the trigger (a date arriving, a repeat coming due, the agenda going non-empty).\n- Or rule that olai is deliberately pull-only — and write that down, since today the absence is stated nowhere.","created":"2026-08-20T17:40:46-04:00","changed":"2026-08-24T16:04:18-04:00","custom":{"channel-answered":"2026-08-24 roadmap review: \"nothing notifies anywhere\" is no longer true — #358 shipped the whole alert CHANNEL as a reusable app-root seam (notify.ts over @kolu/surface-app/notify, click payload deliberately a shared union with \"one arm today\"; chime, PWA badge, prefs row, served SW). What this node still owns is only the TRIGGER (a date arriving, a repeat due, the agenda going non-empty) and the pull-only ruling","from":"repo survey 2026-08-20 (Opus explore agent), on the human's ask"}}
